### Get all entries (default: page 0, size 10, sorted by createdAt desc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries

###

### Get entries with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?page=0&size=5

###

### Get entries with custom page size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?page=0&size=20

###

### Get entries sorted by number ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?sortBy=numberValue&sortDirection=asc

###

### Get entries sorted by selector descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?sortBy=selectorValue&sortDirection=desc

###

### Get entries sorted by free text ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?sortBy=freeText&sortDirection=asc

###

### Get entries with all parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?page=0&size=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc
